/T (For working out any amount under 4 days a week, I suggest you look at my Intermediate Full Body programs for women instead. You could attempt 2 Lower and 1 Upper on this programme for 3 days a week, but the Full Body alternatives and Lower Only alternatives for 3 days are specifically faster ways to target the Full Body more or the Lower body more depending on your goals. These also work well for busy athletes that only want to strength train 3 days a week. 5+ days will get you the most aesthetic results if you can stick to the programme, but 3 days is better if you would struggle to hit the 5 due to conflicting sports sessions or life events. 3 days may result in slower muscle growth, but it is still a great option.)
